noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[51,55,45,32,25,43],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"8550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP14006","armor":"WP1012005","helmet":"WP1019605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1057","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[51,55,45,32,25,43],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP14006","armor":"WP1012005","helmet":"WP1019605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10250","city":"CS1057","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[51,55,45,32,25,43],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP14006","armor":"WP1012005","helmet":"WP1019605"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东吴将领。东吴名将周瑜的侄孙——其父周峻是周瑜哥哥的儿子，因周瑜的功勋官至偏将军，领兵千人。周峻去世后，大将全琮曾向孙权举荐周护为将。但孙权以周护性行危险 （品行不端、心术不正）为由拒绝，担心任用其会招致祸患。尽管孙权感念周瑜的功勋，但最终还是放弃了对周护的提拔。","tc":"東吳將領。東吳名將周瑜的侄孫——其父周峻是周瑜哥哥的兒子，因周瑜的功勛官至偏將軍，領兵千人。周峻去世后，大將全琮曾向孫權舉薦周護為將。但孫權以周護性行危險 （品行不端、心術不正）為由拒絕，擔心任用其會招致禍患。盡管孫權感念周瑜的功勛，但最終還是放棄了對周護的提拔。","en":"A general of Eastern Wu and grandnephew of the renowned Eastern Wu general Zhou Yu. His father, Zhou Jun, was the son of Zhou Yu's elder brother and had risen to the rank of Lieutenant commanding a thousand troops on account of Zhou Yu's merits. Following Zhou Jun's death, Senior General Quan Cong recommended Zhou Hu to Sun Quan for a generalship. Sun Quan, however, refused on the grounds that Zhou Hu's character was volatile and treacherous, fearing that employing him would invite disaster. Though mindful of Zhou Yu's distinguished service, Sun Quan ultimately refrained from promoting him.","jp":"東呉の将。東呉の名将・周瑜の甥孫。父の周峻は周瑜の兄の子であり、周瑜の功績によって偏将軍に至り、兵千人を率いていた。周峻の死後、大将の全琮が孫権に周護を将として推挙した。しかし孫権は、周護の性行が危険（品行が悪く心術が曲がっている）であるとしてこれを拒絶し、任用すれば禍を招くと懸念した。孫権は周瑜の功績に思いを寄せていたものの、最終的には周護の登用を見送った。","kr":"동오의 장수. 동오의 명장 주유의 종손이다. 아버지 주준은 주유의 형의 아들로, 주유의 공훈 덕분에 편장군에 이르고 군사 1천 명을 통솔했다. 주준이 세상을 떠난 뒤 대장 전종이 손권에게 주호를 장수로 천거했으나, 손권은 주호의 성행이 위험하다(품행이 바르지 못하고 마음씨가 흉험하다)는 이유로 그를 기용하면 화를 부를까 염려하여 거절했다. 손권은 주유의 공훈을 늘 가슴 깊이 새기고 있었으나, 결국 주호를 발탁하지는 않았다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1045815","remark":"普武","surname":"周","surnameTc":"周","surnameEn":"Zhou","surnameJp":"周","surnameKr":"주","surnameOther":"","name":"护","nameTc":"護","nameEn":"Hu","nameJp":"護","nameKr":"호","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"周护","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"249","city":"CS1057","gender":"0","rule":"51","force":"55","wise":"45","politics":"32","charm":"25","will":"43","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"4","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"7/57/8/21/21/12/21/21","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4200","battleSoulPoint":"6000","debateSoulPoint":"5000","strategy":"","strategy2":"1000905","professions":"3/1/0/1/0/3/1/0/0/0/1/1/3/1/1/0/2/1/0/0/0/3/2/2","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"72","loyalty":"0","reputation":"950","evaluate":"-5000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"222","show":"236","death":"281","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"3","weapon":"WP14006","armor":"WP1012005","helmet":"WP1019605","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;18/1;25/1;10/1;3/1;30/1;28/1;5/1;22/1","father":"WJ1045715/0","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":""